# JAYSTARBLISS STUDIOS — ACADEMIC PERFORMANCE, GRADING & OFFICIAL REPORTING SYSTEM

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Extend the existing Jaystarbliss Dynamic Institute application with a comprehensive Academic Performance Management and Official Reporting System.

This system will enable authorized Jaystarbliss platform administrators and tutors assigned to schools or individual learners to:

1. Locate existing assessments and official reports using their unique reference numbers.
2. Configure grading systems for an entire school, a class, a programme or an individual learner.
3. Aggregate a learner's academic performance across assessments, assignments, activities, tests and examinations.
4. Generate official end-of-term reports for school learners.
5. Generate comprehensive end-of-session reports covering all three school terms.
6. Generate end-of-programme reports for private learners.
7. Generate end-of-year reports for private learners.
8. Save, track, review, issue, retrieve and download official reports.

This must be implemented as a unified academic reporting architecture, not as a standalone PDF generator.

